create_payment: description  -invoice +lightningInvoice -amount (sats), +amountSats,
get_job_result: description  -segments }; +segments, srt, vtt } (a result too large for one reply comes back without segments, srt and vtt, with resultTruncated, omitted and fullResultUrl: a free link to the whole result);
transcribe_audio: description  -Up +Priced per minute of audio; a 66-minute file works in one call. A result too large for one reply (word timestamps pass it after a few minutes of audio) comes back without segments, srt and vtt, with fullResultUrl: a free link -500 MB / 60 minutes per file. +the whole result.

pabandi_discover: description  -Return the Pabandi Trust Protocol +Get PTP -document: public +(public). Returns -endpoint URL, protocol +endpoint, -supported -bands/entity +bands, entity +No auth required.
pabandi_get_ledger: description  -Public audit lookup of +Look up -idempotency key. +idempotencyKey (public audit). -fee ($PAB), owner, agent, risk band, capabilities. +feePab, ownerUserId, agentId, riskBand, capabilities, chargedAt. Example: {"idempotencyKey": "iss-3001"}
pabandi_issue_passport: description  -Passport. +Passport (auth required via Bearer token from the owner). -are -owner -issue (idempotent). Authentication required. +issue; idempotent via idempotencyKey. Example: {"agentId": "svc-agent-7", "capabilities": ["act:book", "read"], "idempotencyKey": "iss-3001"}. Get API key at POST /api/v1/agents/register.
pabandi_verify_passport: description  -(agent, business, individual, or trust +(agent/business/individual/trust -a +token -optionally require a capability +optional need -granted capabilities, risk band, expiry. Offline-verifiable: re-executes HMAC-SHA512 over a fixed field subset. +grantedCapabilities, riskBand, expiresAt. Works offline. Example: {"token": "...base64...", "need": "act:book"}
